  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="2" para="true">SECT. VII. CAP. II.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">1. <i>Quænam spectanda, si de vero sensu</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3">
      <i>statuti difficultas?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">2. <i>Si sensus statuti investigari nequeat,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5">
      <i>ad statuti conditorem erit recur-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>rendum.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">3. <i>An si statutum sit juris communis de-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>rogatorium, extensivam admit-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9">
      <i>tat interpretationem?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10" para="true">4. <i>Si sensus dubius talis adhibenda inter-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>pretatio, quæ juri communi mi-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>nus adversetur.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">5. <i>Et statutum, quod simpliciter loquitur,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>intelligendum est secundum jus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>commune.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">6. <i>Statutum, quo victus victoriin ex-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>pensas tenetur, sic accipiendum,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>si non habuerit justam litigandi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19">
      <i>causam.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">7. <i>Statutum continens verba taxativa,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21">
      <i>quandoque extensivam admittit</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22">
      <i>interpretationem.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">8. <i>Si statutum dictet in casubus non ex-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>pressis ad jus commune recurren-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25">
      <i>dum</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
